  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Peruvian working-class cumbia hybrid formed circa 1968-1980 between Lima's Andean migrant barrios and the oil-boom Amazon towns of Pucallpa and Moyobamba, codified by Los Destellos, Juaneco y su Combo and Los Mirlos, joining Colombian cumbia's 4/4 güiro pattern to surf-fuzz Farfisa-and-guitar timbres and huayno-derived pentatonic melodies.",
